<title>HONG KONG: Indian Railway Finance Corp mandates FRN issue.</title>
<headline>Indian Railway Finance Corp mandates FRN issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run Indian Railway Finance Corp (IFRC) has mandated ANZ Investment Bank to lead manage a floating rate note issue, ANZ said on Friday.</p>
<p>The seven-year issue is expected to be US$100 to US$150 million in size.</p>
<p>Government approval is still pending, ANZ said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
